Zihao: November 15 (Bitcoin BTC - Ethereum ETH) Latest Market Analysis and Trading Strategy

Zihao: Bitcoin (BTC) Strategy:
Image
Long Opportunity: If the price pulls back to $94,000-$95,000 (close to the key support level), a small position can be tried for a long, with a target looking towards $96,000-$97,000 (rebound repair range), and a stop loss set at $93,500 (exit immediately if support is broken);

Short Opportunity: If the price rebounds to $97,500-$98,000 (short-term resistance level), a light position can be taken for a short, with a target looking towards $96,000 (retest support), and a stop loss set at $98,500 (stop loss if resistance is broken);

Notes: Avoid full position trading, keep leverage within 2 times to prevent black swan events.


Zihao: Ethereum (ETH) Strategy:

Long Opportunity: If the price falls to $3,050-$3,100 (support range), a long can be tried, with a target looking towards $3,200 (short-term rebound target), and a stop loss set at $3,000 (exit if support is broken);

Short Opportunity: If the price rebounds to $3,250-$3,300 (resistance range), a light position can be taken for a short, with a target looking towards $3,150 (retest support), and a stop loss set at $3,350 (stop loss if resistance is broken);

Notes: ETH is more volatile than BTC, position size should be reduced (recommended to occupy 10%-15% of total funds), avoid excessive exposure. #BTC #ETH

